msgid "Name"
msgstr "Izina"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Give this account a meaningful name that will be displayed."
msgstr "Ha iyi konti izina rifite igisobanuro rizajya rigaragara."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Izina ry'ukoresha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The username that will be used for authentication."
msgstr "Izina ry'ukoresha rizakoreshwa mu kwemeza umwirondoro."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Ijambobanga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The password used for authentication."
msgstr "Ijambobanga rikoreshwa mu kwemeza umwirondoro."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Password"
msgstr "Fungura Ijambobanga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your Enable Password, if required."
msgstr "Ijambobanga ryawe rya Enable, niba rikenewe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable Device"
msgstr "Emerera igikoresho"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disabled this device from being backed up."
msgstr "Kura akamenyetso muri aka gasanduku kugira ngo uhagarike ikorwa ry'ikopi y'umutekano kuri iki gikoresho."

#: includes/arrays.php router-accounts.php
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Ibisobanuro"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Name of this device (will be used for config saving and SVN if no hostname is present in config)."
msgstr "Izina ry'iki gikoresho (rizakoreshwa mu kubika amagenamiterere no muri SVN niba nta zina rya mwakirizi riri mu magenamiterere)."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "Aderesi ya IP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the IP Address used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Iyi ni Aderesi ya IP ikoreshwa mu kuvugana n'igikoresho."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devices.php
msgid "TFTP Server"
msgstr "Seriveri ya TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional TFTP server this device copies its configuration to. Leave blank to use the global TFTP Server setting."
msgstr "Seriveri ya TFTP itari ngombwa iki gikoresho gikoperaho igenamiterere ryacyo. Siga harimo ubusa kugira ngo ukoreshe amagenamiterere rusange ya Seriveri ya TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stored SSH Host Key"
msgstr "Urufunguzo rwabitswe rwa Mwakirizi wa SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Compare this host-key algorithm and SHA-1 hex fingerprint with the device through a trusted channel. On the server, replace the path below with the matching public host-key file and run: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Use the device action to clear it after a legitimate key change."
msgstr "Gereranya ubu buryo bwa host-key n'igikumwe cya SHA-1 hex hamwe n'igikoresho unyuze ku muyoboro wizewe. Kuri seriveri, simbuza inzira iri hasi dosiye ya public host-key bijyanye hanyuma ukoreshe: awk '{print $2}' /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub | base64 -d | openssl dgst -sha1 | awk '{print toupper($NF)}'. Koresha igikorwa cy'igikoresho kugira ngo ubisibe nyuma y'ihinduka ry'urufunguzo ryemewe."

#: includes/arrays.php router-backups.php router-devices.php
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Ububiko"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the relative directory structure used to store the configs."
msgstr "Iyi ni imiterere y'ububiko bwerekeye ikoreshwa mu kubika amagenamiterere."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Schedule Type"
msgstr "Ubwoko bw'ingengabihe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How often to Backup this device. Daily with a Rerun Every of 10 performs a backup every 10 days; Monthly performs a true calendar-month backup."
msgstr "Inshuro zo gukora kopi y'umutekano y'iki gikoresho. Buri munsi hamwe na Kongera Gukora Buri 10 bikora kopi y'umutekano buri minsi 10; Buri kwezi bikora kopi y'umutekano y'ukwezi nyako kw'ingengabihe."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/functions.php router-devices.php
msgid "Rerun Every"
msgstr "Ongera ukore buri"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For Daily schedules, rerun the backup every X days. For Weekly schedules without specific Days of Week, rerun it every X weeks; once Days of Week are selected the backup runs on those days every week and this field does not apply."
msgstr "Kuri gahunda za buri munsi, ongera ukore kopi y'uburinzi buri minsi X. Kuri gahunda za buri cyumweru zidafite Iminsi y'Icyumweru yihariye, ongera uyikore buri byumweru X; iyo Iminsi y'Icyumweru yahiswemo, kopi y'uburinzi ikorwa kuri iyo minsi buri cyumweru kandi aka gace ntikagikoreshwa."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week"
msgstr "Iminsi y'icyumweru"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Weekly schedule, the day(s) of the week to run the backup on, every week. Leave empty to run every Rerun Every weeks instead."
msgstr "Kuri gahunda ya Buri cyumweru, umunsi (iminsi) y'icyumweru yo gukoreraho kopi y'uburinzi, buri cyumweru. Bireke birimo ubusa kugira ngo ikore buri byumweru bya Ongera ukore buri aho kubikora gutyo."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Months of Year"
msgstr "Amezi y'umwaka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the month(s) of the year to run the backup in."
msgstr "Kuri gahunda ya Buri kwezi, ukwezi (amezi) y'umwaka yo gukoreramo kopi y'uburinzi."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Month"
msgstr "Iminsi y'ukwezi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly schedule, the day(s) of the month to run the backup on (Last = last day of the month)."
msgstr "Kuri gahunda ya Buri kwezi, umunsi (iminsi) y'ukwezi yo gukoreraho kopi y'uburinzi (Wa nyuma = umunsi wa nyuma w'ukwezi)."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Weeks of Month"
msgstr "Ibyumweru by'ukwezi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the week(s) of the month to run the backup in."
msgstr "Kuri gahunda ya Buri kwezi ku Munsi, icyumweru (ibyumweru) by'ukwezi byo gukoreramo kopi y'uburinzi."

#: includes/arrays.php includes/scheduler.php
msgid "Days of Week (Monthly)"
msgstr "Iminsi y'icyumweru (Buri kwezi)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For a Monthly on Day schedule, the weekday(s) to pair with the Weeks of Month selection."
msgstr "Kuri gahunda ya Buri kwezi ku Munsi, umunsi (iminsi) y'icyumweru yo guhuza n'amahitamo y'Ibyumweru by'Ukwezi."

