#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "Dosiye y'igenamiterere"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the standard location of the configuration file on the remote device. It is used for SCP and SFTP method"
msgstr "Aha ni ho hasanzwe habikwa dosiye y'igenamiterere ku gikoresho cya kure. Bikoreshwa ku buryo bwa SCP na SFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Copy TFTP"
msgstr "Koporora TFTP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to send the backup to tftp server."
msgstr "Uyu ni umwandiko wa CLI ukoreshwa mu kohereza kopi y'umutekano kuri seriveri ya tftp."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Capture Command"
msgstr "Ibwiriza ryo gufata"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional command whose output is saved as the configuration, instead of copying it to a TFTP server. It always runs over SSH, whatever the Connection Type, and the device then needs no TFTP server. Leave blank for devices that copy their configuration to TFTP. Example for MikroTik RouterOS: /export"
msgstr "Itegeko ritari ngombwa rifite ibisohoka bibikwa nk'igenamiterere, aho kubikopera kuri seriveri ya TFTP. Rihora rikorera kuri SSH, uko Ubwoko bw'Ihuzanzira bwaba bumeze kose, kandi icyo gikoresho ntikiba gikeneye seriveri ya TFTP. Siga harimo ubusa ku bikoresho bikopera igenamiterere ryabyo kuri TFTP. Urugero kuri MikroTik RouterOS: /export"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Show Version"
msgstr "Erekana verisiyo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the CLI text used to display the current version."
msgstr "Uyu ni umwandiko wa CLI ukoreshwa mu kwerekana verisiyo iriho ubu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Confirmation Prompt"
msgstr "Ikibazo cy'Iyemeza"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the confirmation prompt to match before transmission."
msgstr "Ubu ni ubutumwa bwo kwemeza bugomba guhura mbere yo kohereza."

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Emeza"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Hari ubutumwa bwo kwemeza mbere yo gukoporora imiterere?"

#: includes/arrays.php router-devtypes.php
msgid "Force Confirm"
msgstr "Hatira Kwemeza"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Is there a force confirmation prompt for copying the config?"
msgstr "Hari ubutumwa bwo kwemeza ku gahato mbere yo gukoporora imiterere?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check End in Config"
msgstr "Genzura impera mu igenamiterere"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check end in config?"
msgstr "Genzura impera mu igenamiterere?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Any Key prompt"
msgstr "Ubutumwa bw'urufunguzo urwo ari rwo rwose"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Text to match a 'Press Any Key To Continue' styled prompt"
msgstr "Inyandiko ihura n'ubutumwa busaba nka 'Kanda Buto Iyo Ari Yo Yose Kugira Ngo Ukomeze'"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Post-Login Prompts"
msgstr "Ubutumwa bwa nyuma yo kwinjira"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional prompt/response pairs sent right after login, before the copy-to-TFTP command, one per line as prompt|response. The prompt is matched as a case-insensitive regular expression against the device output (so it cannot itself contain |, and brackets and other special characters must be escaped, e.g. Save \\[y/n\\]), and the response is sent as typed, or use <CR> to send just a carriage return. A response is only sent once its prompt has been seen, either in the reply to the previous response or in later output; otherwise a warning is logged and nothing is sent. These are answered first; the Any Key prompt above is answered later, while the device is being enabled, so a prompt answered here never reaches Any Key. Example: Press any key|<CR>"
msgstr "Amatsinda atari ngombwa y'ikibazo/igisubizo yoherezwa nyuma gato yo kwinjira, mbere y'itegeko ryo gukopera kuri TFTP, rimwe ku murongo nka prompt|response. Ikibazo gihuzwa nk'imvugo isanzwe itita ku nyuguti nkuru cyangwa nto ku bisohoka by'igikoresho (bityo ubwacyo ntigishobora kuba kirimo |, kandi udukomo n'izindi nyuguti zidasanzwe bigomba gutangwa n'akarango ko gutoroka, urugero Save \\[y/n\\]), kandi igisubizo cyoherezwa uko cyanditswe, cyangwa ukoreshe <CR> kugira ngo wohereze gusa gusubira ku murongo mushya. Igisubizo cyoherezwa gusa iyo ikibazo cyacyo kimaze kugaragara, haba mu gisubizo cy'igisubizo cyabanje cyangwa mu bisohoka byakurikiyeho; bitabaye ibyo iburira ryandikwa mu makuru kandi ntacyo cyoherezwa. Ibi bisubizwa mbere; ikibazo cya Any Key kiri haruguru gisubizwa nyuma, igihe igikoresho kiri gufungurwa, ku buryo ikibazo gisubirijwe hano kitigera kigera kuri Any Key. Urugero: Press any key|<CR>"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere rusange"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Presentation Mode"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo kwerekana"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Should Router Configs be presented on the Console or a Top Tab."
msgstr "Ese igenamiterere rya Router rigomba kugaragara kuri Console cyangwa ku gice cyo hejuru."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Console"
msgstr "Konsole"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Top Tab"
msgstr "Agafishi ko hejuru"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Config Diff Context Lines"
msgstr "Imirongo y'Igisobanuro mu Itandukaniro ry'Igenamiterere"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The default number of unchanged lines to display before and after each change when comparing two backups. A larger value makes it easier to see the surrounding configuration context. This may be overridden per comparison on the Compare page."
msgstr "Umubare usanzwe w'imirongo itahindutse yo kwerekana mbere na nyuma ya buri mpinduka igihe hagereranywa kopi zibitswe ebyiri. Umubare munini woroshya kubona imiterere y'igenamiterere riyikikije. Ibi bishobora guhindurwa ku buryo bwihariye kuri buri kugereranya ku rupapuro rwa Gereranya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connection timeout"
msgstr "Igihe cyo guhuza cyarenze"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum time to wait in seconds when establishing the initial network connection to a device. A hung or unreachable device is abandoned after this timeout so a scheduled backup run continues with the remaining devices."
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cyo gutegereza mu masegonda igihe hatangizwa ihuza rya mbere ry'umuyoboro ku Gikoresho. Igikoresho cyahagaze cyangwa kitagerwaho kirarekwa nyuma y'iki gihe kugira ngo igikorwa cyateguwe cyo kubika amakuru gikomeze ku bindi Bikoresho bisigaye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Close without exit"
msgstr "Funga udasohotse"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If ticked, when closing down the device connection, no 'exit' command is issued"
msgstr "Niba hashyizweho akamenyetso, igihe ufunga ihuza ry'Igikoresho, nta tegeko rya 'exit' ritangwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Debug Connection Buffer"
msgstr "Ububiko bw'agateganyo bwo gukemura ibibazo by'ihuzanzira"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to log direct output of device connection"
msgstr "Niba handikwa mu bubiko bw'inyandiko ibisohoka ako kanya mu ihuza ry'igikoresho"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Assume all devices elevated"
msgstr "Fata ko ibikoresho byose bifite uburenganzira bwisumbuye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Whether to assume all devices are elevated"
msgstr "Niba hafatwa ko ibikoresho byose bifite uburenganzira bwo hejuru"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Download Hour"
msgstr "Isaha yo gukurura"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The hour of the day to perform the full downloads."
msgstr "Isaha y'umunsi yo gukoreraho gukurura amakuru byuzuye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retry Schedule"
msgstr "Gahunda yo kongera kugerageza"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The time to wait before attempting to perform an additional download when scheduled download fails"
msgstr "Igihe cyo gutegereza mbere yo kugerageza gukurura bundi bushya igihe ikurura ryateganyijwe ryananiwe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Retention Period"
msgstr "Igihe cyo kubika"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The number of days to retain old backups."
msgstr "Umubare w'iminsi yo kubika kopi z'ububiko zishaje."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Keep Inactive Device Backups"
msgstr "Bika kopi z'igikoresho kidakora"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When checked, the retention cleanup will not delete aged-out backups that belong to disabled devices or to devices that have been removed, so configurations for decommissioned or unreachable equipment are retained."
msgstr "Iyo bihiswemo, isukura ry'ibibitswe ntirizasiba kopi z'ububiko zashaje z'Ibikoresho byahagaritswe cyangwa ibyakuweho, kugira ngo amagenamiterere y'ibikoresho byavanywe ku murongo cyangwa bitagerwaho akomeze kubikwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Transfer Options"
msgstr "Amahitamo yo Kohereza"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default connection type"
msgstr "Ubwoko mburabuzi bw'ihuzanzira"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Default type of connection used to communicate with the device."
msgstr "Ubwoko mburabuzi bw'ihuzanzira bukoreshwa mu kuvugana n'igikoresho."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate By Device"
msgstr "Tandukanya ukurikije Igikoresho"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Separate archived Configs into a folder per device"
msgstr "Tandukanya Igenamiterere ryabitswe mu bubiko bwa buri gikoresho"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Dated Subdirectory"
msgstr "Ububiko bwungirije buriho itariki"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert a date-based subdirectory into the archive path (before the per-device folder), so each run is stored under its backup date, e.g. .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Off preserves the existing layout."
msgstr "Shyiramo ububiko bwungirije bushingiye ku itariki mu nzira y'ububiko bw'inyandiko (mbere y'ububiko bwa buri gikoresho), kugira ngo buri gikorwa kibikwe munsi y'itariki y'ububiko bwacyo, urugero .../2020-11-04/hostname/.... Iyo bihagaritswe bigumana imiterere isanzwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SCP Path"
msgstr "Inzira ya SCP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When using SCP, leaving this blank will use PHP's SCP module which does not always work. External SCP is disabled while SSH host key verification is enabled because it cannot reuse the verified connection."
msgstr "Iyo ukoresha SCP, gusiga aha hantu hari ubusa bizakoresha igice cya SCP cya PHP kidakunze gukora buri gihe. SCP yo hanze iba Yahagaritswe mu gihe igenzura ry'urufunguzo rwa Mwakirizi ya SSH Ryafunguwe kuko itashobora kongera gukoresha ihuza ryagenzuwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verify SSH Host Keys"
msgstr "Genzura imfunguzo za mwakirizi wa SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Record each device's SSH host key on first connect and refuse to send credentials if it later changes. SSH/Telnet mode will not fall back to Telnet while verification is enabled. After a legitimate key change, use the device action to clear the stored host key."
msgstr "Andika urufunguzo rwa mwakirizi wa SSH rwa buri gikoresho ku kwihuza kwa mbere kandi wange kohereza ibyangombwa byo kwinjira niba nyuma ruhindutse. Uburyo bwa SSH/Telnet ntibuzasubira kuri Telnet mu gihe igenzura ryafunguwe. Nyuma y'ihinduka ryemewe ry'urufunguzo, koresha igikorwa cy'igikoresho kugira ngo usibe urufunguzo rwa mwakirizi rwabitswe."

