#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Config Diffs"
msgstr "Shyiramo Itandukaniro ry'Amagenamikorere"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Append a unified diff of each device whose configuration changed during the run to the backup Email, so a reviewer can see exactly what changed. Binary (non-text) configurations are skipped. Volatile lines that change on every backup (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' and 'Current configuration :', and NX-OS '!Time:' and '!Running configuration last done at:') are always ignored. Warning: the diff is sent in clear text to every recipient of the Email, so it can reveal configuration that should stay private; leave Include Secrets in Diffs unchecked."
msgstr "Ongeraho itandukaniro rihuriweho ry'igikoresho cyose cyahinduye igenamiterere mu gihe cy'igikorwa ku Imeyili y'ububiko bw'inyunganizi, kugira ngo ugenzura abashe kubona neza icyahindutse. Amagenamiterere ya binari (atari umwandiko) arasimbukwa. Imirongo ihindagurika kuri buri bubiko bw'inyunganizi (Cisco IOS '! Last configuration change', '! NVRAM config last updated', 'ntp clock-period' na 'Current configuration :', na NX-OS '!Time:' na '!Running configuration last done at:') irengagizwa buri gihe. Iburira: itandukaniro ryoherezwa mu mwandiko ugaragara kuri buri muntu wakiriye Imeyili, bityo rishobora kugaragaza igenamiterere rikwiye kuguma ari ibanga; reka 'Shyiramo Amabanga mu Matandukaniro' bitatoranyijwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Include Secrets in Diffs"
msgstr "Shyiramo Amabanga mu Matandukaniro"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Send secret values in the emailed diff as they are. When unchecked (the default), the changed lines are found on the raw configurations and printed redacted, failing closed: lines containing secret-like words (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) and SNMP host and user lines are reduced to their first word followed by &lt;secret hidden&gt;, and every line of a PEM block, a certificate or key-string block, or a multi-line quoted value, and any hex or base64 row, is hidden; a block that never ends hides the rest of the configuration. This also hides harmless lines (e.g. a description mentioning a key), but every changed line still shows up, marked (changed) when only its hidden part differs, and a block that never ends is noted in the Email. Stored backups are never changed."
msgstr "Ohereza indangagaciro z'ibanga mu itandukaniro ryo kuri imeyili uko ziri. Iyo bitatoranyijwe (ari byo bisanzwe), imirongo yahindutse iboneka ku igenamiterere ritaratunganywa kandi ikandikwa ihishwe, ifungwa ku buryo budafungura mu makosa: imirongo irimo amagambo asa n'ibanga (passw, passphrase, pwd, secret, psk, key, community, md5, authentication, credential, token, private) n'imirongo ya mwakirizi n'ukoresha ba SNMP igabanywa ikaba ijambo ryayo rya mbere rikurikiwe na &lt;secret hidden&gt;, kandi buri murongo w'igice cya PEM, icyemezo cyangwa igice cy'urukurikirane rw'urufunguzo, cyangwa agaciro kari mu twuguruzo ku mirongo myinshi, ndetse n'umurongo uwo ari wo wose wa hex cyangwa base64, birahishwa; igice kidashira gihisha ibisigaye byose by'igenamiterere. Ibi binahisha imirongo itagira icyo itwaye (urugero: ibisobanuro bivuga urufunguzo), ariko buri murongo wahindutse ukomeza kugaragara, ukagaragazwa nka (changed) igihe igice cyayo gihishwe ari cyo cyonyine gitandukanye, kandi igice kidashira kigaragazwa mu Imeyili. Inkopi zibitswe ntizihindurwa na rimwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Diff Exclude Patterns"
msgstr "Imiterere Ikumirwa muri Diff"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Optional regular expressions (one per line) matching configuration lines to ignore when comparing, so volatile lines such as timestamps or serial numbers do not show up as changes. Each pattern is matched case-insensitively anywhere in a line unless anchored with ^ or $; a pattern that is not a valid regular expression is ignored."
msgstr "Imvugo zisanzwe zitari ngombwa (imwe ku murongo) zihura n'imirongo y'igenamiterere igomba kwirengagizwa igihe ugereranya, kugira ngo imirongo ihindagurika nk'ibihe cyangwa imibare iranga ibikoresho itagaragara nk'impinduka. Buri cyitegererezo gihuzwa hatitawe ku nyuguti nkuru cyangwa nto aho ari ho hose mu murongo keretse iyo gifashwe na ^ cyangwa $; icyitegererezo kitari imvugo isanzwe yemewe kirirengagizwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Thold Notification List"
msgstr "Urutonde rw'Amamenyesha ya Thold"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When Thold is installed, also send the backup Email to the recipients of the selected Thold Notification List."
msgstr "Iyo Thold yashyizweho, ohereza kandi Imeyili y'ububiko ku bagenerwa bo ku Rutonde rw'Imenyesha rwa Thold rwatoranyijwe."

